# .env for the MemoryAgentBench working directory — NOT the repo root.
#
#     cp hnav/deploy/mab.env.template \
#        In-Episode-Knowledge/INEP-KNOW/MemoryAgentBench/.env
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS — and why NEXT_STEPS.md §6 "Correction 2" is wrong
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_STEPS.md claims the :8001 embedding server is not needed for the
# MemoryAgentBench arena, because `Qwen3Embedding4BEmbeddings` loads the model
# in-process via transformers. That class exists (embedding_retriever.py:51) but
# `TextRetriever.__init__` NEVER SELECTS IT. Read embedding_retriever.py:176-183:
#
#     elif embedding_model_name == "Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-4B":
#         import dotenv
#         _env = dotenv.dotenv_values()   # reads ./.env, bypassing os.environ
#         self.embedding_model = OpenAIEmbeddings(
#             model=embedding_model_name,
#             openai_api_base=_env.get("OPENAI_BASE_URL") or os.environ.get("OPENAI_BASE_URL"),
#             openai_api_key=_env.get("OPENAI_API_KEY") or os.environ.get("OPENAI_API_KEY"))
#
# So the arena DOES need a served /v1/embeddings endpoint. It is dead code, not
# an in-process path.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THE TWO-ENDPOINT SPLIT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Embeddings and the LLM both key off the name OPENAI_BASE_URL, but they read it
# from DIFFERENT SOURCES, which is what lets them point at different ports:
#
#   embeddings : dotenv.dotenv_values()  -> THIS FILE wins over the environment
#   LLM        : OpenAI() bare ctor      -> os.environ ONLY (never reads a file)
#                (embedding_retriever.py:298, the use_deepseek=False branch)
#
# Therefore:
#   THIS FILE      OPENAI_BASE_URL=:8001  -> embeddings, GPU1
#   YOUR SHELL     export OPENAI_BASE_URL=:8000  -> the LLM, GPU0
#
# Do not export OPENAI_BASE_URL=:8001; that would send the LLM calls to the
# embedding server. Do not delete this file expecting the shell export to cover
# both — it cannot, they need different values.

# Embeddings → :8001 (Qwen3-Embedding-4B on GPU1)
OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8001/v1
OPENAI_API_KEY=EMPTY

# Some code paths prefer DEEPSEEK_* when set. Point them at the real LLM so a
# stray lookup cannot land on the embedding port.
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=EMPTY
